OL,3,GNEWSARescue team's busy year prompts
OL,4,Apreparation plea
OL,5,
OL,6,FWith just over six weeks still to go
OL,7,Fbefore the end of the year, Wasdale
OL,8,FMountain Rescue Team (WMRT) has
OL,9,Frecorded its busiest year ever.
OL,11,FA call out to two men stuck on Great
OL,12,FGable, one with a suspected ankle
OL,13,Finjury, on Thursday was the 169th of
OL,14,Fthe year, beating the team's previous
OL,15,Frecord of 168.
OL,17,FAssistant team leader Chad Dixon said
OL,18,Fthe figure was likely to be about 175
OL,19,Fby the end of the year which would
OL,20,F"test the resilience" of the team.
OL,23,APub: 15-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NW Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
