OL,3,GNEWSARescue team's busy year prompts
OL,4,Apreparation plea
OL,5,
OL,6,FTo cut down on potential calls, he
OL,7,Furged anyone visiting the Lake District
OL,8,Ffells to be prepared for all
OL,9,Feventualities, including sudden changes
OL,10,Fof weather.
